{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corrupted Basement is an atmospheric survival horror game where you're trapped in a series of dark and unfamiliar basements. Your only goal: escape. Each basement presents a different challenge, demanding a unique way to open the exit \u2014 all while having to stay one step ahead of a relentless presence that stalks the halls alongside its corrupted creations.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880060/extras/ad628aadcfdf4290f9fb2b1006b0eca5.avif?t=1759409004\" width=616 height=55 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880060/extras/6004d819c80e1a83528e348bb936cd9e.poster.avif?t=1759409004\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880060/extras/6004d819c80e1a83528e348bb936cd9e.webm?t=1759409004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880060/extras/6004d819c80e1a83528e348bb936cd9e.mp4?t=1759409004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If it finds you, the chase begins. Escape before it turns you into one of its creations.<i> </i><br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880060/extras/780a0f5989cace5963ebe51911b850b0.avif?t=1759409004\" width=616 height=55 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880060/extras/f7a78d0c1b69ed51ef26041a22b8eefe.poster.avif?t=1759409004\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880060/extras/f7a78d0c1b69ed51ef26041a22b8eefe.web